{v_1 : bool, v_2 : tensor} |= if v_1 then true else max(v_2) < min(v_2) * -1
>>
Rule 153 (String parameter must be either 'linear', or start with 'soft')
{v_1 : str} |= v_1 = "linear" ∨ v_1 = "softmax" ∨ v_1 = "softplus"
>>
Rule 154 (The product of the first two dimensions modulo the sum of the other 2 should be equal to 0, but if ndim<4 , product of first two should be even.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) < 4 then (shape(v_1, 0) * shape(v_1, 1)) % 2 = 0 else (shape(v_1, 0) * shape(v_1, 1)) % (shape(v_1, 2) + shape(v_1, 3)) = 0
>>
Rule 155 (If the tensor dimensions are greater or equal than 1, and smaller then 4 the last dimensions has to be smaller than 200)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_1) < 4 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) < 200
>>
Rule 156 (The tensor v_1 must be a matrix where the column size has to be smaller than row)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 then shape(v_1, 0) > shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 157 (If the number of dimensions in v_1 is 2, then the value of the tuple v_2 in position 0 must be grater than value of tuple in position 1)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ v_2.len = 2 then v_2[0] > v_2[1]
